msgid "Jalali Calendar"
msgstr "Kalender Jalali"

msgid ""
"Optional Shamsi (Jalali) calendar extension. Persian users get Jalali "
"display, date/time pickers, and FullCalendar month/year views. Stored values"
" stay Gregorian. Enable via local_settings.py."
msgstr ""
"Perpanjangan kalender Shamsi (Jalali) opsional.Pengguna Persia mendapatkan "
"tampilan Jalali, pemilih tanggal/waktu, dan tampilan Kalender Penuh "
"bulan/tahun.Nilai-nilai yang tersimpan tetap bersifat Gregorian.Aktifkan "
"melalui local_settings.py."

msgid ""
"Phase 1: DateTimeFormatter, calendar_system on HorillaUser, inline-edit "
"parse hooks, Jalali date/time pickers, and FullCalendar Shamsi month/year "
"views. No core template or settings patches."
msgstr ""
"Fase 1: DateTimeFormatter, sistem_kalender di HorillaUser, kait pengurai "
"inline-edit, pemilih tanggal/waktu Jalali, dan tampilan bulan/tahun "
"FullCalendar Shamsi.Tidak ada templat inti atau tambalan pengaturan."

msgid "Shamsi (Jalali)"
msgstr "Syamsi (Jalali)"

msgid "Gregorian"
msgstr "Gregorian"

msgid "Calendar System"
msgstr "Sistem Kalender"

msgid ""
"Choose Shamsi (Jalali) or Gregorian dates when your language is Persian."
msgstr ""
"Pilih tanggal Shamsi (Jalali) atau Gregorian jika bahasa Anda adalah bahasa "
"Persia."
